{"nodes": [{"id": "l3_analyste_analyse_doc", "label": "L3 \u2014 AN-B Analyste (conception technique)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/brainstorm/L3-analyste-analyse.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "l3_analyste_analyse_tache_analyste", "label": "T\u00e2che analyste (claude -p, outils Read Glob Grep)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/brainstorm/L3-analyste-analyse.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seule t\u00e2che automatique avec outils, en lecture seule (amendement IV) : rep\u00e9rer code mort ou ligne fautive exige de lire le code ; --setting-sources \"\", --strict-mcp-config, --max-turns 40, d\u00e9lai 15 min ; cwd = d\u00e9p\u00f4t d\u00e9sign\u00e9."}, {"id": "l3_analyste_analyse_aigateway", "label": "AIGateway", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/brainstorm/L3-analyste-analyse.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Constitution III : tout appel IA lanc\u00e9 par l'app passe par l'AIGateway."}, {"id": "l3_analyste_analyse_dossier_analyse", "label": "Dossier d'analyse balis\u00e9 (AnalysisDossierBuilder, \u2264 40 000 car.)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/brainstorm/L3-analyste-analyse.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Agr\u00e9gats sans contenu (jamais les \u00e9v\u00e9nements bruts), graphe de code 017, m\u00e9moire \u2264 30 propositions ; tronqu\u00e9 par priorit\u00e9 erreurs > lenteurs > IA > parcours > inutilis\u00e9s."}, {"id": "l3_analyste_analyse_cles_obs", "label": "Cl\u00e9s citables obs:<type>:<n>", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/brainstorm/L3-analyste-analyse.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_